# U52: PoB's own behaviour. The list beside the build list (BuildList.lua:93, getPublicBuilds)
# fetches Trending at Init, but its Draw returns at `if true then return end` (L249): nothing of
# it is drawn and no Import/Preview button is ever created. Its controls are still there for
# input: a click on its empty area takes the focus from the build list (so the wheel reaches the
# list's OnKeyUp, whose scroll bar is disabled), a click where the invisible "Latest" tab is
# fetches the Latest list (the response arrives next frame; nothing shows), and a click where an
# Import button would be does nothing.
#! u52-setup list
#! expect-no-text Trending
#! expect-no-text Loading..
#! expect-no-text Righteous Fire
#! u52-expect-keys 2
#! u52-expect-mode LIST
fixture userdir=../../fixtures/user1
fixture net=net.json
frames 3
move 1250 400
click LEFTBUTTON
wheel down 2
frames 1
move 1206 69
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
move 1150 250
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 2
